#: ../../source/getting-started/index.rst:2
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "开始使用"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Use this section to get from a fresh installation to your first useful "
"session."
msgstr "本节将帮助你从全新安装开始，完成第一个有用的会话。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.rst:15
msgid "The shortest path"
msgstr "最短路径"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.rst:17
msgid "Install Studio on Windows."
msgstr "在 Windows 上安装 Studio。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"Complete the first-run setup, or skip optional steps and return to them "
"in Settings."
msgstr "完成首次运行设置，或跳过可选步骤，稍后再从设置中完成。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.rst:20
msgid "Add a workspace for your project."
msgstr "为项目添加一个工作区。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.rst:21
msgid "Create a session, choose a model, and describe one concrete task."
msgstr "创建会话，选择模型，并描述一个具体任务。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.rst:22
msgid "Review the proposed changes and verification output."
msgstr "审查提议的变更和验证输出。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"You do not need to configure every integration before asking a question. "
"A provider is the only essential integration for an AI conversation; "
"Godot and offline documentation become important when you want Godot-"
"aware work."
msgstr "提问前不需要配置所有集成。对于 AI 对话，供应商是唯一必要的集成；当你需要进行 Godot 感知的工作时，Godot 和离线文档才会变得重要。"
